    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72172" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθόννα</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>greater celandine, Chelidonium
				majus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.180
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				27.109
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>juice of</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀθόννα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				2.182
			</span></i> ; also, <i>the juice of various other plants,</i> ibid.,
			cf. <i><span class="en">
				Zopyr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				14.45.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> an Egyptian
			stone, <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				7.3
			</span></i>.</div>
